  A gunman fired from a rooftop at an ICE facility, shooting three immigrants
  shackled in a van, two

  of whom later died. The shooter died from a self-inflicted gunshot.

  A gunman rammed a truck into an LDS Church, opened fire, and set the building
  on fire, killing four

  church members and injuring eight others before he was killed.

  A shooter, identified as Patrick White, fired hundreds of shots at the CDC
  headquarters to protest

  COVID-19 vaccines, killing one DeKalb County police officer. (The search
